# slider-keys (h8-points-slider): focus the track via h's box + Tab, then
# ArrowRight twice and Shift+ArrowRight: 2 -> 2.1 -> 2.2 -> 3.2, written
# through the debounce. Behaviour: aria-valuenow 3.2, p=3.2 in the URL.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
click 331.5 599.5
wait 200
key Tab
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight shift
wait 1200
shot slider-keys
